# Files copied into each new git worktree (`claude --worktree <name>` / `ccvm <project> --worktree`).
# Gitignore-style patterns. A pattern only takes effect if the file is ALSO gitignored — tracked
# files are never duplicated. Keeps per-worktree secrets/env present so parallel streams can run.
# See docs/parallel-workstreams.md.
.env
.env.*
